  2	
  3	**EVERY visualization MUST start from this skeleton.** Copy it, then add content. This gives you themes, print styles, Inter font, animations, menu, and hover effects — all working out of the box.
  4	
  5	**Design philosophy: CSS-first, JS-minimal.** Animations use CSS `@keyframes` and `transition` (always reliable). JavaScript is only for: menu, theme toggle, scroll observer, number counters, and PNG download. No animation libraries required.
